diagram class
notation Starr
presentation default
orientation landscape
color medical
sheet A2
padding l250 b100
frame Model Integration Diagram
frame_presentation default
nodes
    Pace Program 8,2
    Organ 6,2
    Active Program 7,4
    Cued Program 9,3-4
    Event 7,7
    Active Phase 8,5-6
    Pace Timeout Period/2 5-6,7
    Active Pace Period/2 4-5,5
    Task Timeline 4-5,2
    Task Window 2,2
    Open Window 3,3-4
connectors
    -R50 : -/1 t*|Organ : -/1 b|Pace Program, l|Active Program
    -R51.2 : +/1 r|Pace Program : +/2 t|Active Program, b|Cued Program
    -R52 : +/2 r|Active Program : +/2 l*|Event, b|Active Phase
    -R53 : +/1 b|Active Program : +/2 l|Pace Timeout Period, t|Active Pace Period
    -R54 : -/1 b|Task Timeline : -/1 t*|Task Window, l|Open Window
